<title>UK: ABB unit sets A$100 million five-year bond. [CORRECTED 09:20 GMT]</title>
<headline>ABB unit sets A$100 million five-year bond. [CORRECTED 09:20 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects lead manager to Hambros Bank from Nomura)</p>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABB INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> KEEPWELL   ASEA BROWN BOVERI AG</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    27.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.47    PAY DATE    27.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/AM/NETH ANT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
